#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:22
#: 4104d928f3414b3a9d735995758d00c1
msgid "This article explains how to set up the shutter-trigger for Canon Cameras that support the *Canon Hacker Development Kit* (CHDK). The method connects the ArduPilot output to the camera using a \\*custom cable\\*, and causes a script running on the camera to take pictures when the *relay* output voltage goes high."
msgstr ""

